# Who may approve a pull request to main by adding the `approved` label.
#
# One GitHub login per line; `#` starts a comment. The login check ignores case.
# scripts/ship/owner-approve.sh reads this file from the BASE commit, so a pull
# request cannot add itself to the list. The repository variable APPROVERS wins
# over this file when it is set, which is how another repo picks its own
# approvers without editing a file in the tree (docs/pipeline-rollout.md).
#
# Teammates are deliberately not on this list: they open pull requests, Derek
# approves them.
derek-hobden
